WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,400
Zhou Tian, don’t scare me, I’m timid

2
00:00:03,560 --> 00:00:05,160
If you have something to say, hurry up and leave quickly

3
00:00:06,940 --> 00:00:09,340
Your mother said that the water leaked from the fire

4
00:00:09,540 --> 00:00:11,140
You all know that you just won’t fix it for her.

5
00:00:22,210 --> 00:00:23,810
Why didn't my grandma tell me in a dream?

6
00:00:26,220 --> 00:00:28,020
It doesn’t seem to be burning anymore

7
00:00:28,870 --> 00:00:30,270
You have been hot and cold while hiking lately

8
00:00:30,270 --> 00:00:32,070
Your body is weak and only your milk can cover you

9
00:00:32,470 --> 00:00:34,470
From now on, practice on time, and you'll have to walk around with Ghost Sword.

10
00:00:34,870 --> 00:00:36,470
But she loved me the most when she was alive

11
00:00:36,870 --> 00:00:38,270
Why are you torturing me like this now?

12
00:00:38,270 --> 00:00:39,470
If the ghost doesn't reincarnate for a long time,

13
00:00:39,470 --> 00:00:41,070
The seven emotions and six desires will slowly disappear

14
00:00:41,270 --> 00:00:42,470
Although she knows you are her grandson

15
00:00:42,470 --> 00:00:43,870
But I have no feelings for you anymore

16
00:00:43,870 --> 00:00:45,070
Then I will die

17
00:00:45,070 --> 00:00:46,070
Is this also the case?

18
00:00:46,070 --> 00:00:47,270
So when you are alive

19
00:00:47,270 --> 00:00:48,870
Be filial to whomever you should be filial to

20
00:00:51,540 --> 00:00:52,540
I know the rules

21
00:00:52,940 --> 00:00:55,340
But I only have this money left in my hand, so I’ll take two hundred

22
00:00:55,340 --> 00:00:56,940
Let's go back together among friends.

23
00:01:06,720 --> 00:01:07,920
Don't panic, I'll go there now

24
00:01:11,530 --> 00:01:12,530
What do you want from me?

25
00:01:13,180 --> 00:01:14,580
They two have something to say

26
00:01:14,580 --> 00:01:15,780
Then wait for them to speak first

27
00:01:15,980 --> 00:01:17,180
Me and this immortal family

28
00:01:17,180 --> 00:01:19,180
I want to go to your temple to practice

29
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:21,200
Then come to me directly

30
00:01:21,200 --> 00:01:23,400
Why bother bothering your grandson anymore?

31
00:01:23,400 --> 00:01:25,600
Not just any cute guy or dog can go to court.

32
00:01:27,980 --> 00:01:28,980
How to speak

33
00:01:29,380 --> 00:01:30,580
What paradise have you just left?

34
00:01:30,780 --> 00:01:31,980
Just look down upon others with dog eyes

35
00:01:32,380 --> 00:01:33,780
See if I don’t teach you a lesson

36
00:01:34,700 --> 00:01:35,700
Take a look and try

37
00:01:45,900 --> 00:01:48,090
This ghost general shocked the place as soon as he showed up.

38
00:01:48,290 --> 00:01:49,690
It seems that I am really good at this job.
